"slug": "gundam-conquest", "summary": "The powerful collaboration between the nationally beloved robot anime \"Mobile Suit Gundam\" and the popular smartphone game \"Kingdom Conquest,\" which has achieved over 5 million downloads (\u203b), has finally come to fruition! This is an online-only game where you can play with tens of thousands of players! Players can play both the simulation part, where you develop colonies and wage war, and the action part, where up to four players can cooperate. Strengthen your forces and aim for victory!\n\nThe mobile versions were delisted after mid 2017. The versions' service was ended on October 29, 2018. There is a PS Vita port.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/gundam-conquest", "videos": [{"id": 164399, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "NPhsN9yK8Zo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NPhsN9yK8Zo", "title": "Gundam Conquest - CM - iOS/Android", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NPhsN9yK8Zo/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 164402, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "LklHe8GiCQc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LklHe8GiCQc", "title": "\u300aGundam Conquest\u300b\u92fc\u5f48\u7248\u570b\u738b\u5f81\u670d SEGA\u8de8\u754c\u5408\u4f5c\u51fa\u64ca\uff01_\u96fb\u73a9\u5b85\u901f\u914d20131223", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LklHe8GiCQc/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 164403, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "odxSrOhZN-E", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odxSrOhZN-E", "title": "Gundam Conquest: TV Commercial Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/odxSrOhZN-E/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 164405, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "kJm3goDs2Mg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kJm3goDs2Mg", "title": "Gundam Conquest - Action (RX78-1 Prototype Gundam)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kJm3goDs2Mg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 164406, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "SqbROHLJ-YI", "url": "https://www.